<title>FRANCE: Svenska to become specialist French share trader.</title>
<headline>Svenska to become specialist French share trader.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Bourses' Association SBF said that Svenska France had received its permission to become a full French share dealer and said this activity would start in April 1997.</p>
<p>Svenska France is a unit of Svenska Handelsbanken.</p>
</text>
